        "prefix_token_count": 318,
        "step_number": 3,
        "text": "Step 3: Use the given condition \\( |PF_1 - PF_2| = 24 \\) to find \\( 2a \\). For a hyperbola, \\( 2a \\) is the constant difference in distances from any point on the hyperbola to the two foci. Therefore,\n\\[ 2a = 24 \\]\nSo, \\( a = 12 \\)."
      },
      {
