        "prefix_token_count": 395,
        "step_number": 4,
        "text": "Step 4: Calculate \\( b \\) using the relationship \\( c^2 = a^2 + b^2 \\):\n\\[ 13^2 = 12^2 + b^2 \\]\n\\[ 169 = 144 + b^2 \\]\n\\[ b^2 = 25 \\]\n\\[ b = 5 \\]"
      },
